    "description": "Pilot\nMetropolitan MR Fountain Pen - Gold Champagne Finish\nModern Era, Fine (F) Stainless Steel Nib\nThe Pilot Metropolitan, part of the MR series, is widely regarded as one of the finest entry-level fountain pens, balancing sophisticated design with exceptional writing performance. This example features a matte gold-toned metal body with a polished center band, representing the clean, professional aesthetic for which Japanese stationery manufacturing is renowned.\nDurable metal body construction with a comfortable weighted feel for writing stability\nGenuine Pilot stainless steel nib marked \"Fine\" (\n) and \"Japan\"\nIncludes original black protective storage case with transparent viewing lid\nComes with a full box of 12 Pilot Namiki IC-100 black fountain pen ink cartridges\nTotal weight of set is 1 lb\nCondition:\nVery good pre-owned condition. The gold finish remains bright and uniform across the cap and barrel with minimal surface wear. The nib appears clean and properly aligned. The storage case is intact, though the clear lid shows light surface scuffing. Ink cartridge box is included.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
