    "description": "Title:\nQuartz Crystal Geode Bookends Blue With Single Polished Agate Slice Lot 3\nCondition:\nUsed\nCondition Description:\nMinor chip on one bookend, shows light wear\nStyle:\nNatural\nColor:\nBlue, Gray, Brown\nCategory:\nHard Goods\nType:\nBookends\nFeatures:\nPolished face, natural edge\nFinish:\nPolished/Raw\nMaterial:\nQuartz\nNumber In Pack:\n3\nRoom:\nLiving Room\nTheme:\nGeode\nUnit Quantity:\n3\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nElevate your decor with this unique lot featuring a pair of striking blue quartz geode bookends and a separate polished quartz crystal slice. The bookends boast a polished blue tone with natural rough edges and crystalline patterns exposed on the inside, making them an eye-catching way to display books or simply enhance a shelf. The additional quartz slice presents beautiful translucent gray and white banding with a hollowed geode center, offering a versatile accent for desktops or side tables. These natural geode pieces are both visually appealing and durable, lending a touch of earthy elegance and stability to your space. Please note, one bookend has a small chip at the bottom edge, with general light surface wear consistent with previous display and handling. Together, these three pieces bring natural beauty and distinctive texture to any room, perfect for geode enthusiasts or anyone looking to add a refined mineral accent to their collection.",
